### 1. Register Student
POST http://localhost/canteenq/backend/api/auth/register.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Student",
  "email": "student2@college.local",
  "password": "Student@123",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "college_id": "CSE2026099"
}

### 2. Login Admin
POST http://localhost/canteenq/backend/api/auth/login.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@canteen.local",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 3. Get Menu
GET http://localhost/canteenq/backend/api/menu/list.php

### 4. Get Public Queue Status
GET http://localhost/canteenq/backend/api/queue/status.php
